  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>The Electronet is a special Weapon frequently employed by bounty hunters to bring down fleeing prey. An Electronet can only be fired from a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenade_Launcher\" title=\"Grenade Launcher\">Grenade Launcher</a>. When an Electronet is fired from a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenade_Launcher\" title=\"Grenade Launcher\">Grenade Launcher</a>, target a 2x2 square area and make an attack roll, comparing the result to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of each target in the area. </p><p>If a target is hit, it takes <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> damage from the Electronet and is <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grabbed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grabbed\">Grabbed</a> as per the normal rules for a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Net\" title=\"Net\">Net</a>. Each round, at the beginning of your turn, any targets still trapped by the Electronet take <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> damage from the Weapon at its normal amount. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;This is an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;Weapon. </p><p><b>Special:</b> Can only be fired from a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenade_Launcher\" title=\"Grenade Launcher\">Grenade Launcher</a>. </p>",
